    "visibleText": "00\nIntro\nAntwerp 14:46\nBack to 1984\nStart a project\nStart a project\nMenu\nClose\nFig. 01 · Keypad\nx 0.70\ny 0.33\nPixels change.\nTaste stays.\n\nWebdrift is a design and development studio in Antwerp. We design and build custom websites and web apps.\n\nView our projects\nView our projects\nStart a project\nStart a project\nFig. 01 · Web design and development\nSince 2022\nStudio\n\nStudio\n\nSmall by choice, involved at every step. One point of contact for your entire website, with the same care and attention from the first conversation to the finishing touches at launch.\n\nFig. 02\nBased in\nAntwerp, since 2022\nTools\nShaders, scripts, too much coffee\nAbout the studio\nAbout the studio\nOur approach\nOur approach\nApproach\nDesign\nbrief.txt\n\nThe brief\n\nGoals\n\nAudience\n\nWhat the site must do\n\ndesign.fig\nindex.html\n\n<section\nclass=\"hero\"\n>\n\n  \n<h1>\nHello.\n</h1>\n\n</section>\n\n_\n\nwebdrift.be\n\nLive\n.\n\nLaunched and looked after.\n\n01 Brief\n02 Design\n03 Build\n04 Launch\nDevelopment\nSelected work\n\nRecent websites, designed and built to measure by the same small studio.\n\n01\n/ 04\nMEGA Charge\nHillside\nXwift\nTrendwolves\nE-mobility & charging infrastructure\nMEGA Charge\nHillside\nXwift\nTrendwolves\n\nCharging infrastructure, Energy-as-a-Service and software for electric truck fleets, in one ecosystem.\n\nDevelopment of the full site in three languages, built from the supplied design.\n\nRole\nDevelopment\nStatus\nLive\nView project\nView project\nOne studio\n01 / 04\nDesign.\n\nDesign, development and motion under one roof.\n\nView all projects\nContact\nAntwerp 14:46\nA project\nin mind?\nhello@webdrift.be\nStart a project\nHome\nWork\nApproach\nStudio\nContact\nLange Lozanastraat 14\n2018 Antwerp\nBE0785.607.750\nPrivacy\nCookies\nCookie settings\nNL\nEN\n\nHello.\nHello.\nHallo.\nBonjour.\nHola.\nCiao.\nHej.\nOlá.\nHello.\n\nBack to top\n© 2026 Webdrift\n\nCookies\n\nYour privacy matters.\n\nWe